/*
 * Daily tree only: keep board.dtb inside the M4 loader's window (m4,board-dtb-max, 98,304 B since rev 12).
 *
 * aurora's 2026-10-27 J616s description (every SMC sensor and its die thermal zones, the remaining PMGR power
 * states, DARTs, mailboxes, SIO, ANE, AVE, consoles) took the DTB from 76 KB to 164 KB, and m4-boot refuses it.
 * This deletes the nodes that were added since aurora e3a9c0a and that nothing kept references (phandle or alias
 * path): the new hwmon sensors and thermal zones, unused new power domains and the disabled new devices. Nodes
 * the 7.3.0-m4.103 tree had are untouched. Generated with tools/dtb-trim.py; regenerate after a rebase.
 */
